Implemented and verified a Track B minimal forbidden propagation set generator based on the paper’s Proposition 2 and Section 4.3 cycle separator. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.18533)

Key results:

- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Guess resistance: 0/200,000; exact probability \(1/5{,}000{,}077\).
- Four no-tool attacks: 0/8 each.
- Reference algorithm: 8/8, averaging 144,656,344 operations and 3.14 seconds.
- Bare, structural-hint, and placebo oracle arms: all 0/3.
- Witness: 17 characters, 3 atoms, approximately 64 intended operations.

Deliverables:

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.18533/gen_2605_18533.py:1)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.18533/README.md:1)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.18533/selftest_report.json:1)
- [Bare oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.18533/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl:1)
- [Structural-hint transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.18533/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl:1)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.18533/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl:1)
